This repository is an evaluation archive. It documents a locked measurement
of Fusion Aperture. It does not contain Fusion Aperture.

1. Unlicensed materials

The Fusion Aperture inference stack, source code, binaries, kernels, runtime,
unpublished methods, and any model weights belonging to Fusion Aperture are
not in this repository and are not licensed by this file. No copyright license,
patent license, trademark license, or reverse-engineering right is granted for
those materials. Presence of this archive is not a distribution of the stack.

